'''{{BASEPAGENAME}}''' is a [[Beast]] [[Companion]] [[mod]] that allows the companion's melee attacks to add to the owner's [[Melee Combo]]. Performing a [[Heavy Attack]] will bolster the companion's melee damage for 30 seconds.

