==Acquisition==
The mod can be bought from [[Master Teasonai]] for {{sc|20,000}} after reaching '''Rank 3 - Trusted''' with the [[Ostron]]s.

==Notes==

* Companion melee attacks reset the [[Melee Combo#Combo Duration|combo timer]].
* Works with the extra targets from {{M|Swipe}}, as well as the shadow Kavats from {{M|Territorial Aggression}}.
* If a player has a riven with -chance to gain combo, the player can gain combo count with this mod, regardless, even in cases where the negative chance is past 100.
* Each spore that is popped from {{M|Viral Quills}} counts as 1 melee hit, meaning one enemy with the maximum of 10 spores will result in 66 combo gained.
** The Vulpaphyla's melee attacking efficiency is hampered due Viral Quills' low cooldown, causing it to spend considerable time casting and reacquiring targets.
** {{M|Swipe}} helps the Vulpaphyla to hit all spores more consistently, as well as those on nearby enemies.
* Damage bonus is multiplicative to base damage mods like {{M|Maul}}, {{M|Precision Conditioning}}.
** Damage bonus can be refreshed.
** The heavy attack needs to actually connect/hit a enemy to trigger the buff.

==Bugs==

* Tandem Bond's damage bonus from combo consumption does not work on Heavy Slams or [[Glaive_(Weapon_Type)|Glaive's]] recall explosion.

